          "text": "Kodwa yilowo nalowo wesifazane kumelwe atsheleke izinto zesiliva nezegolide nezingubo kumakhelwane wakhe nakuyena ohlala endlini yakhe; ulidwebe phezu kwamadodana akho namadodakazi akho; futhi kumelwe niphange abaseGibhithe.",
